  "findings": [
    "First setup failed on nonexistent CameraActor.get_camera_component; fixed to get_component_by_class(CameraComponent) in fresh Runtime02. Empty Runtime01 map is retained locally, not published.",
    "Startup capture had black/reference then incomplete materials; shader worker crashed at frame104, engine used direct compilation fallback. Baseline warm-up run has no logged errors and fully textured captures.",
    "Root reviewed 15 overview sheets (50 startup,50 warmed baseline,50 fixed captures). Textured walking and gradual turns are visible after warm-up; many groups remain stationary. Overview tiles downsample 2:1; original1280x720 images retained.",
    "Blocked solo VAT branch previously assigned Heading+90. It now uses the original heading, the same elapsed-time allowance and existing90deg/s cap. Fixed native maximum3.000002deg over4096updates at30Hz versus93deg in64baseline rows.",
    "All runs seeded48 with zero refusals/ground misses and two poses. Fixed log has no errors. Ground trace success is not a foot-sliding/collision acceptance test.",
    "Current root continuity <0.000001005cm in64 retained samples. Previous-frame reconstruction maximum4.561284cm remains; this is not a physical jump or a velocity-buffer fix."
  ],
  "next": "Diagnose stationary group recovery, broaden native movement/foot-contact routes, all-cast reduction and performance. Packaged/photo/dove regressions and independent browser walkthrough remain open.",
